[resource]
script = ExtResource("3_byjpg")
icon = ExtResource("2_pky3j")
label = "Heightmap"
tooltip = "Exports and imports heightmap data from and (on)to the terrain.

[b]Info[/b]:
The [EDITOR_ACCENT]Export Tab[/EDITOR_ACCENT] allows for the exporting of terrain data as greyscale PNG's (heightmap, grass mask, texture index).

The [EDITOR_ACCENT]Import Tab[/EDITOR_ACCENT] can then utilise these greyscale PNG's as data for the creation of terrain chunks.

The [EDITOR_ACCENT]Library Tab[/EDITOR_ACCENT] differs in that it can create heightmaps from 3D meshes and then place them onto the terrain via a heightmap brush. It's best used for quickly terraforming the terrain in complex ways.

[b]Shortcuts[/b]:
[ul]Shift+R: Rotate the current heightmap 90 degrees clockwise.[/ul]"
attributes = SubResource("Resource_he")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://brkjbcthwswel"
